body:
Four player-facing #2440 improvements on the authoritative Lane War route guard:

- after automatic salvage, report restored material counts instead of only saying materials were refunded;
- while route validation/reopen is pending, keep the live placement preview fenced and amber with CHECKING/RESTORING guidance instead of showing green BUILD VALID;
- replicate the two route-fence state bits so that guidance is visible on the owning multiplayer client, not only on authority;
- preserve that route-fence guidance even when the player looks off a valid ground target instead of falling back to NO BUILD TARGET.

Proof on exact head: python -m pytest scripts/v2/tests/test_v2_construction_player_input.py -q -> 31 passed; git diff --check passed. Native OMEN lane was not admitted because live /mnt/ue free space is 36 GiB, below lane 2's 40 GiB admission floor.
